  <name>Kickoff Launcher for the COSMIC™ desktop</name>
  <summary>A KDE-style application menu for the COSMIC™ desktop</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Browse, search, favourite, pin and launch installed applications from
      the COSMIC panel. Grid, list and hybrid layouts, with a choice of menu
      size and panel icon.
    </p>
  </description>
  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/justinkelly/cosmic-ext-kickoff-launcher</url>
  <url type="bugtracker">https://github.com/justinkelly/cosmic-ext-kickoff-launcher/issues</url>
